             run_int_1RB1RD_1LC0RC_0RB1LD_1LA0LD (Ap_Alph_00_10_1 q0 ++ [S0]) [] j
             ltac:(discriminate) ltac:(reflexivity)).
  f_equal. exact (gei_1RB1RD_1LC0RC_0RB1LD_1LA0LD p j q0 E).
