    apply (fire_via_ovf_lift tm Cc Hi (StC, S0)).
    intros p1 j1 E1. apply (fire_lift_of_csteps tm Cc).
    apply (fireo_1RB____1LC1RB_0RA1LD_0LC0LC [SRotL 1; SWin 1; SCycL 2 0; SWin 4; SCycR 2; SWin 1; SWinR 2] (StC, S0) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
