    + rewrite (cview_none_shape p1 0 E1).
      exact firez_D1_1RB____1LC1RB_1RA1LD_0RB0LC.
    + exact (fireo_1RB____1LC1RB_1RA1LD_0RB0LC [SRotL 1; SWin 1; SCycL 2 0; SWin 6] (StD, S1) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
                   p1 j1' E1).
Qed.

